  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A precision-crafted, five-dimensional liquid foundation brush for seamless, second-skin application.<strong><br><br>Brush Formulation:</strong> Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Brush Coverage:</strong> Buildable</p><p><strong><br>Bristle Type:</strong> Synthetic</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> It is cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use with Supr&#234;me Bio-Complex Liquid Foundation or any liquid foundation.<br>-Blend formula seamlessly in upward and outward motions for a natural finish.<br>-Clean regularly with gentle brush cleanser to maintain bristle quality.</div></details>",
